BSD license in LICENSE. UPSTREAM.json records hashes BEFORE local modifications.
Local patch: hackrf_open_fd wraps an Android permission-granted descriptor,
verifies HackRF One USB ID 1d50:6089, then uses normal open setup.
libusb does not own the borrowed descriptor. The app exposes reception only.
RF amplifier and antenna power start disabled.
